---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="What's New in Panama 2025 — Key Updates for Expats" description="The most important changes to Panama's immigration, healthcare, real estate and infrastructure in 2025. Updated for prospective expats." lang="en">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <div class="mb-10">
      <a href="/en/" class="text-jade text-sm hover:underline">← Home</a>
      <span class="block text-jade text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-medium mt-4 mb-2">2025 Update</span>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl text-slate mb-3">What's New in Panama for Expats</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Panama's immigration and services landscape keeps evolving. These are the most important changes and updates to know as of 2025.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 mb-14">

      <!-- Qualified Investor Visa -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-jade/15 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="bg-jade/10 px-5 py-3 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-xl">🏆</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-slate text-sm">Qualified Investor Visa — New Lower Threshold</p>
            <span class="text-xs text-jade font-medium">Effective October 2024</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white px-5 py-5">
          <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            The minimum real estate investment for the Qualified Investor (Golden) visa was reduced from <strong>$500,000 to $300,000</strong>. This change, effective October 2024, opens the investor visa to a significantly larger pool of applicants.
          </p>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-lg border border-jade/15 bg-fog text-sm">
              <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs mb-1">Before (until Oct 2024)</p>
              <p class="font-bold text-coral">$500,000 minimum</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 rounded-lg border border-jade/15 bg-fog text-sm">
              <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs mb-1">Now (from Oct 2024)</p>
              <p class="font-bold text-jade">$300,000 minimum</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs mt-3">Processing time: approximately 30 business days from filing. Pre-construction properties are eligible. <a href="/en/visas/qualified-investor/" class="text-jade hover:underline">See full requirements →</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pensionado streamlined -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-jade/15 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="bg-jade/10 px-5 py-3 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-xl">⚡</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-slate text-sm">Pensionado Visa — Faster Processing</p>
            <span class="text-xs text-jade font-medium">2025</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white px-5 py-5">
          <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Panama's Immigration department has streamlined Pensionado visa processing with reduced waiting times. The temporary residency card is now issued in approximately 5 business days after filing the complete application. <a href="/en/visas/pensionado/" class="text-jade hover:underline">See the full Pensionado guide →</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Medicare -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-jade/15 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="bg-jade/10 px-5 py-3 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-xl">🏥</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-slate text-sm">Medicare & US Insurance — Direct Billing Expanded</p>
            <span class="text-xs text-jade font-medium">2025</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white px-5 py-5">
          <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm leading-relaxed">
            US Medicare Advantage plans and select US insurance policies are now accepted with direct billing at an expanded set of Panamanian hospitals — no prepayment required, no reimbursement claims to file. This is a major quality-of-life improvement for US retirees. Check with your specific insurer and the hospital before your visit.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Starlink -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-jade/15 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="bg-jade/10 px-5 py-3 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-xl">🛰️</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-slate text-sm">Starlink — Rural Connectivity Transformed</p>
            <span class="text-xs text-jade font-medium">2023–2025</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white px-5 py-5">
          <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Starlink satellite internet has transformed connectivity in Panama's previously disconnected rural, coastal, and mountain areas. Locations like Pedasí, remote beach communities, and highland farming towns now have reliable high-speed internet — opening these areas to remote workers for the first time. This has materially expanded where expats can realistically live and work remotely in Panama.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Real estate trends -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-jade/15 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="bg-jade/10 px-5 py-3 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-xl">🏘️</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-slate text-sm">Real Estate — New Affordable Destinations Emerging</p>
            <span class="text-xs text-jade font-medium">2025 Trend</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white px-5 py-5">
          <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            While Panama City remains the #1 destination, several secondary markets are gaining popularity specifically for their affordability and value. Panama City and Boquete continue to see rising prices as demand grows.
          </p>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
            {[
              ["Chitré", "Azuero Peninsula value play", "~$600–900/mo"],
              ["Dolega", "Between David & Boquete", "From $400/mo"],
              ["Penonomé", "2 hrs from capital", "$400–600/mo"],
            ].map(([town, desc, price]) => (
              <div class="p-3 rounded-lg border border-jade/15 bg-fog text-center text-sm">
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate">{town}</p>
                <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs">{desc}</p>
                <p class="text-jade font-bold mt-1">{price}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Public healthcare expansion -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-jade/15 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="bg-jade/10 px-5 py-3 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-xl">🏗️</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-slate text-sm">Public Healthcare — New Hospital in Boquete</p>
            <span class="text-xs text-jade font-medium">Expected 2025</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white px-5 py-5">
          <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm leading-relaxed">
            A new public hospital for Boquete is under construction with an opening expected in 2025. This will significantly improve emergency and routine care access for residents of the Chiriquí highlands without requiring a trip to David. The expansion of public healthcare continues across several areas of the interior.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- International education -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-jade/15 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="bg-jade/10 px-5 py-3 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-xl">📚</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-slate text-sm">International Education — Bilingual & Remote Learning Growing</p>
            <span class="text-xs text-jade font-medium">2025 Trend</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white px-5 py-5">
          <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Bilingual schools and distance-learning programs are gaining ground among expat families — particularly in smaller towns where formal international schools are limited. Online US-accredited curricula paired with local social activities are increasingly popular for expat families in Boquete, Volcán, and Pedasí.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- What to watch -->
    <div class="mb-12 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gold/30 bg-gold/5">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-slate mb-3">What to Watch in 2025–2026</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-mid text-sm">
        {[
          "Further streamlining of the Friendly Nations visa process — faster provisional residency timelines expected.",
          "Continued price increases in Boquete and Panama City as demand from expats grows.",
          "Expansion of Starlink coverage and increased competition from fiber providers in secondary markets.",
          "New cruise infrastructure in Colón and the Pacific coast driving tourism growth.",
          "Potential new bilateral tax treaties affecting expats from specific countries.",
        ].map(item => (
          <li class="flex gap-2 items-start">
            <span class="text-jade mt-0.5">→</span>
            <span>{item}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 p-8 rounded-2xl bg-jade/5 border border-jade/15 text-center">
      <p class="font-serif text-xl text-slate mb-2">Staying up to date matters</p>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm mb-5">The blog covers the latest changes and practical updates for Panama expats.</p>
      <a href="/en/blog/" class="inline-flex px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-jade text-white font-medium text-sm hover:bg-jade-dark transition-colors">Read the blog →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
